cff-version: 1.2.0
message: "If you use this code or data, please cite the journal article (once published) and this repository."
title: "UAV-swarm distributed-aperture reception of LEO satellites - simulation code and data"
abstract: >-
  Closed-loop simulator and analysis scripts for a study of predictive control
  versus prediction-free geometric control in UAV-swarm distributed-aperture
  reception of non-cooperative LEO satellites, including a length-controlled
  alignment metric, a connectivity-aperture trade-off analysis, a per-step
  compute budget and a three-site robustness check.
